# PROYECTY AGENTIC FRAMEWORK - RULES & ROLES

## OPERATING MODE
You operate in an Agentic Loop: PLAN -> IMPLEMENT -> TYPE-CHECK (	sc) -> AUTO-CORRECT.

## ARCHITECTURAL CONSTRAINTS
1. ARCHITECTURE: Enforce strict separation: Routes (src/routes) -> Controllers (src/controllers) -> Services (src/services).
2. VALIDATION: Every incoming request must be validated using Zod schemas (src/schemas).
3. DATABASE: Use Drizzle ORM schemas in src/db/schema.ts.
4. STRANGLER FIG: Never delete core endpoints without replacing them with their modular counterpart.

## DEFINITION OF DONE (DoD)
- Clean compilation output for 
px tsc --noEmit.
- Error handling wrapped in Sentry/Global Error Middleware.
- No direct database logic inside controllers (move DB calls to Services).
